      "y": -80,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Palette and rules\n\n- Chunky, flat pixel art\n- Two or three colours: **orange, blue, periwinkle**\n- Pixel cursors and UI bits\n- In 3D: tiny dioramas on black, one hue + one accent, still crisp while the camera orbits\n\n_From TASTE.md. Drag notes in from + NOTE to grow this board._"
    }
